  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IRELAND JOINT UNSDG FUND 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint SDG Fund is a central part of the reform of the UN development system (UNDS), providing Resident Coordinators and UN Country Teams with the means to support programme countries with integrated, interdisciplinary and catalytic policy support aimed at accelerating progress towards the SDGs. This grant is to the United Nations Joint Fund for the 2030 Agenda (the Joint SDG Fund), earmarked to the Food Systems Transformation Window for the for the current financial year (2024) and ODA-eligible activities and expenditure made in line with the Joint SDG Fund&#x2019;s Terms of Reference, Joint SDG Fund 2023-2026 Transitional Strategy and Operational Guidance.</narrative>
  </description>
